Okay so lets go to some basic operation in the linked list

Insertion at the beginnng

public void insertFirst(int value){
    Node node = new Node(value);
    node.next = head;
    node = head;
    if(tail == null){
      tail = head;
    }
    size++;
}

Insertion at the end

public void insertLast(int value){
    if(head == null){
        insertFirst(value);
        return;
    }
    Node node = new Node(int value);
    tail.next = node;
    tail = node;
    size++;
}

Insertion at particular index

public void insert(int value,int index){
    if(index == 0){
      insertFirst(value);
      return;
    }
    if(index == size){
      insertLast(value);
      return;
    }
    Node temp = head;
    for(i=1;i<index;i++){
      temp = temp.next;
    }
    Node node  = new Node(value,temp.next);
    temp.next = node;
    size++;
}











































